  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed development, by reason of its detailed design, position and location would result in an obtrusive and incompatible form of development which would fail to respect the character and appearance of the subject property and the terrace of which it forms part and would fail to preserve or enhance the character and appearance of the Hackney Road Conservation Area. As such the proposed development is contrary to policies D3 (Optimising Site Capacity through the Design-led Approach) and HC1 (Heritage Conservation and Growth) of the London Plan 2021, LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character), LP3 (Designated Heritage Assets) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033, and the guidance contained within Hackney Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD 2025.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The air conditioning units, by reason of its inappropriate location close to adjoining habitable windows, would result in an unacceptable detrimental impact on the living conditions of adjoining residential properties by way of noise and disturbance impacts. Accordingly, the development is considered to be contrary to policy D14 (Noise) of The London Plan 2021 and policies LP2 (Amenity) and LP58 (Improving the Environment - Pollution) of Hackney&#x27;s Local Plan LP33 (2020).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
